BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:my-sportmed-shoulder@fall2026-planner
DTSTAMP:20261110T115206Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261110T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261110T101500
SUMMARY:Sport medicine doctor appointment (left shoulder)
DESCRIPTION:McGill Sport Medicine Clinic\, 475 Avenue des Pins Ouest\, 3rd 
 floor\, room 317 (McGill Sports Complex). Covered by RAMQ (Régie de l'ass
 urance maladie du Québec). End time 10:15 is an estimate. BRING: RAMQ hea
 lth card and McGill ID. Arrive about 10 minutes early. TELL THE DOCTOR: pa
 in at the front top of the left shoulder\, worst when the elbow goes behin
 d the body and the shoulder rolls forward (bottom of dumbbell press\, cabl
 e flyes). Keeps coming back after rest. Both the cross body test and press
 ing on the biceps groove were painful. ASK: what structure is it\, do I ne
 ed imaging\, do I need physio\, and which chest exercises are safe until t
 hen.
END:VEVENT
